.TH PERFECTSENSE 1 "2026-09-09" "PerfectSense 0.0.20" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
perfectsense \- one-shot CLI for Acer Predator PerfectSense sysfs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perfectsense
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B perfectsense
is a
.B human
convenience tool for manual inspection and one-shot tweaks. It reads/writes
PerfectSense sysfs via
.BR libperfectsense .
Desktop UIs and automation should talk to
.B sysfs
or link
.B libperfectsense
directly — not shell out to this CLI.
It does
.B not
require
.BR perfectsensed (8)
for get/set (FanAggressor timer and hotkey policy live in the daemon).
.PP
The kernel module
.B perfectsense.ko
must be loaded and must own the Acer gaming WMI path (unload conflicting
drivers such as
.B nekro_sense
/
.B acer\-wmi
first). Prefer
.B /usr/bin/perfectsense
if a Pandora shim shadows the name on
.BR PATH .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON for commands that support it (notably
.BR status ).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Print thermal profile, AC, fans, temps/RPM, battery/misc, RGB/logo summary.
.TP
.B temps
Print CPU/GPU temperatures in °C (hwmon name
.BR perfectsense ).
.TP
.B gpu powerd get|on|off
Query or force
.B nvidia\-powerd
(Dynamic Boost ~80 W↔~140 W). Normally driven by
.B mode set
(off for eco/quiet; on for balanced+).
.TP
.B gpu powermizer get|set \fR...
Best-effort NVIDIA PowerMizer Preferred Mode (often does not stick on Wayland).
.TP
.BI "mode get" \fR "|" " mode set " name
Get or set the firmware thermal profile (also syncs
.B nvidia\-powerd
on Helios).
Names:
.BR low\-power ,
.BR quiet ,
.BR balanced ,
.BR balanced\-performance ,
.BR performance .
Aliases:
.BR eco ,
.BR turbo ,
.BR bp .
.TP
.BI "fan get" \fR "|" " fan set " "cpu gpu" \fR "|" " fan auto"
Read live duty/RPM or set target duties (percent), or return fans to firmware auto.
.TP
.BI "fan aggressor on" \fR "|" " off" \fR "|" " status" \fR "|" " reload" \fR "|" " set " key=val…
Enable/disable FanAggressor offset mode or edit config.
.B set
and
.BR on / off
persist the conf and send
.B SIGHUP
to
.B perfectsensed
so the timer reloads
.RB ( engage_c ,
offsets, floors, …). Persists under
.I /etc/perfectsense/
when writable.
.TP
.B battery get|on|off
80% charge limiter.
.TP
.B battery calibration get|on|off
Battery calibration mode.
.TP
.B usb get|set \fI0|10|20|30\fR
USB charging while powered off (minutes).
.TP
.B lcd get|set \fI0|1\fR
LCD override (PHN16-72: status bit 48).
.TP
.B kb-timeout get|set \fI0|1\fR
Keyboard backlight 30 s idle timeout.
.TP
.B boot-sound get|set \fI0|1\fR
Boot animation sound.
.TP
.BI "rgb get" \fR "|" " set " "z1 z2 z3 z4" " [" bri "]" \fR "|" " off"
Four-zone static RGB.
.TP
.BI "rgb effect get" \fR "|" " set " csv
Four-zone effect mode (
.IR mode,speed,bri,dir,r,g,b ).
.TP
.BI "logo get" \fR "|" " set " RRGGBB " [" bri "] [" en "]" \fR "|" " off"
Lid / back logo.
.TP
.B lights reset
Reset lighting controller.
.TP
.BI "event inject " name
Synthetic hotkey/AC event for testing
.RB ( turbo ,
.BR mode ,
.BR ac\-online ,
.BR ac\-offline ).
.TP
.B cpu status|preset|restore|snapshot|set \fR...
Userspace CPU power (governor, EPP, turbo, RAPL) and named presets.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_SYSFS
Override path to the
.B perfect_sense
sysfs group.
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_KB_SYSFS
Override four-zone keyboard sysfs group.
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_LOGO_SYSFS
Override lid logo sysfs group.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /sys/devices/platform/perfectsense/perfect_sense/
Primary ABI (
.BR api_version
and attributes).
.TP
.I /etc/perfectsense/fan\-aggressor.conf
Persisted FanAggressor config (when writable).
.TP
.I /run/perfectsense/fan\-aggressor.conf
Runtime override (takes precedence).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR perfectsensed (8)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yPerfectBR/PerfectSense
